<title>BELGIUM: Waigel expected to arrive late at ECOFIN - sources.</title>
<headline>Waigel expected to arrive late at ECOFIN - sources.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Finance Minister Theo Waigel was expected to arrive in Brussels at around 1500 GMT on Monday for talks with other European finance and economics ministers, delegation sources said.</p>
<p>Waigel was delayed as he was attending the funeral of a party colleague in Germany. The talks began at 0900 GMT.</p>
<p>Discussions on the most controversial item on the agenda of the ECOFIN meeting -- the stability pact proposed by Waigel to ensure fiscal discipline within European Monetary Union -- were not expected to end before Waigel's arrival.</p>
</text>
